# Groups and digest parity (GroupsController, GroupMessagesController,
# RealtimeStreamController, DigestController). Groups and digests are flagged,
# so the reference is a second Vapor with SOCIAL_ENABLED=1 GROUPS_ENABLED=1
# GROUPS_PUBLIC_ENABLED=1 DIGEST_ENABLED=1 DIGEST_EMAIL_ENABLED=0 on :18127,
# and v2 on :18117 with the same flags. Every case here leaves the database
# as it found it (reads, refusals, idempotent no-ops). Reset first:
#   docker exec -i norviq-v2-schema-pg psql -U pg -d norviq < parity/groups-setup.sql
#   go run ./cmd/parity -a http://127.0.0.1:18127 -b http://127.0.0.1:18117 -jwt-secret parity-secret \
#     -cases parity/groups.jsonl -ignore requestId,serverTime
