# digest-prefs-put-invalid-json, where Darwin
# Foundation's "Underlying error" text (NSCocoaErrorDomain 3840 with its
# offset) is not reproduced; same as swiftjson.Corrupted in other domains.
# The SSE stream itself is checked in groups/realtime_test.go.
